00:00:45.345 --> 00:00:50.116 align:start size:94% position:6%
-After a recount, that's right
-So I think that, you know

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:54.521
one of the reasons that many
are optimistic about forme

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:57.857 align:start size:94% position:6%
