00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:10.737 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, Seth,
let me just say this,

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:14.240 align:start size:94% position:6%
that the younger generatio
in America today,

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:18.078 align:start size:94% position:6%
