00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:32.759 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it appears that they are
finally,

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:37.030 align:start size:94% position:6%
finally beginning to vote
in large numbers.

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:38.765 size:88% position:44% line:92%
In Texas and in Georgia,

00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:40.867 align:start size:94% position:6%
young people are coming ou
in droves,

00:01:40.867 --> 00:01:43.837 align:start size:94% position:6%
