00:01:49.809 --> 00:01:51.978
And, by the way,
it will go beyond this election.

00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:55.648 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think it's transformativ
for American society

00:01:55.648 --> 00:01:57.117 align:start size:94% position:6%
