00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:20.907
a president who does not believe
in the Constitution

00:02:20.907 --> 00:02:21.841 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
or the rule of law,

00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:25.011
and a president
who does not believe in science,

00:02:25.011 --> 00:02:26.246 align:start size:94% position:6%
and when you don't believe
in science,

00:02:26.246 --> 00:02:30.550 align:start size:94% position:6%
you cannot address the pandemi
that we're seeing today,

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:31.718 line:92%
where the United States no

00:02:31.718 --> 00:02:35.622 align:start size:94% position:6%
