in America today

00:03:01.347 --> 00:03:04.050 align:start size:94% position:6%
that is in very,
very serious trouble.

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:05.885 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Unemployment, very high.

00:03:05.885 --> 00:03:07.187 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Wages, very low.

00:03:07.187 --> 00:03:10.523 align:start size:94% position:6%
90 million people uninsure
or underinsured.

00:03:10.523 --> 00:03:14.827
People cannot afford their
prescription drugs they need

00:03:14.827 --> 00:03:16.496 align:start size:94% position:6%
Kids cannot afford
to go to college

00:03:16.496 --> 00:03:19.065 align:start size:94% position:6%
or are leaving school
deeply in debt.

00:03:19.065 --> 00:03:20.867 line:92%
18 million families spending

00:03:20.867 --> 00:03:24.537 size:78% position:39%
