00:03:35.048 --> 00:03:38.384
Biden will begin to do that,
and that's terribly important.

00:03:38.384 --> 00:03:40.753 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I think those are
the basic reasons

00:03:40.753 --> 00:03:43.456
why people have got to get out
and vote and vote for Biden.

00:03:43.456 --> 00:03:48.161 align:start size:94% position:6%
