working class a little bit

00:03:50.096 --> 00:03:54.133
This was a far more reliable
bloc for the Democratic Part

00:03:54.133 --> 00:03:56.903 align:start size:94% position:6%
maybe in the '50s
and the '60s than it is today.

00:03:56.903 --> 00:04:01.608 align:start size:94% position:6%
Say that in a Biden presidency
