00:04:01.608 --> 00:04:04.677 align:start size:94% position:6%
what would you encourage him
to do to

00:04:04.677 --> 00:04:05.578 line:92%
bring the Democratic Party bac

00:04:05.578 --> 00:04:08.114 align:start size:94% position:6%
