00:04:27.033 --> 00:04:29.435 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I think for many,
many years,

00:04:29.435 --> 00:04:33.406
the Democratic Party has not
paid the kind of attention

00:04:33.406 --> 00:04:36.609 size:81% position:41%
to working-class needs
that they should have.

00:04:36.609 --> 00:04:41.414
And that has a lot to do wit
who funds campaigns, et cetera

00:04:41.414 --> 00:04:42.682 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I think what we have
got to do --

00:04:42.682 --> 00:04:44.817
and let me just tell you,
we are working right now,

00:04:44.817 --> 00:04:46.719 align:start size:94% position:6%
