all over this country.

00:05:28.161 --> 00:05:31.030
It means providing healthcare to
those people who have lost it,

00:05:31.030 --> 00:05:34.801
aid to cities and towns so the
don't have to lay off workers.

00:05:34.801 --> 00:05:37.403 align:start size:94% position:6%
Second of all, we need to rais
the minimum wage

00:05:37.403 --> 00:05:39.839 align:start size:94% position:6%
