to join unions.

00:05:42.742 --> 00:05:45.912 align:start size:94% position:6%
Equal pay for equal work
for women.

00:05:45.912 --> 00:05:50.616
We have got to expand healthcare
to all people.

00:05:50.616 --> 00:05:52.452 align:start size:94% position:6%
We are the only major countr
on Earth

00:05:52.452 --> 00:05:54.954
that does not guarantee
healthcare to all people,

00:05:54.954 --> 00:05:57.223 align:start size:94% position:6%
and that's what
we have got to do.

00:05:57.223 --> 00:05:58.991 align:start size:94% position:6%
We have got to deal
with criminal justice.

00:05:58.991 --> 00:06:00.093 align:start size:94% position:6%
We have to deal
with immigration,

00:06:00.093 --> 00:06:03.396 align:start size:94% position:6%
