00:06:11.204 --> 00:06:15.608
and transforming our energ
system away from fossil fuel

00:06:15.608 --> 00:06:17.710 size:84% position:42%
to energy efficiency
and sustainable energy.

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:22.582 align:start size:94% position:6%
But apropos of what you said
if the Democratic Party

00:06:22.582 --> 00:06:25.184 size:78% position:39%
does not stand firmly
for working families

00:06:25.184 --> 00:06:28.421 align:start size:94% position:6%
and have the courage to take o
the drug companies

00:06:28.421 --> 00:06:30.022 line:92%
and the insurance companie

00:06:30.022 --> 00:06:34.527 align:start size:94% position:6%
and the big-money interests,
shame on them.

00:06:34.527 --> 00:06:38.164 align:start size:94% position:6%
-A very surreal thing
has happened in the time

00:06:38.164 --> 00:06:38.931 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
