Bernie Sanders supporters

00:06:56.783 --> 00:06:58.518 align:start size:94% position:6%
as the perfect
Donald Trump voters.

00:06:58.518 --> 00:07:00.920 size:84% position:42%
How has it been for you
to watch him sort of --

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:03.055
this weird sort of triangulation
of what it means

00:07:03.055 --> 00:07:06.859 align:start size:94% position:6%
