00:07:06.859 --> 00:07:08.661 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, first thought,
we understand

00:07:08.661 --> 00:07:10.630 line:92%
that Trump lies all of the time.

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:12.498 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he's saying,
"Oh, we're going to get

00:07:12.498 --> 00:07:14.767 line:92%
all kinds of Bernie supporters."

00:07:14.767 --> 00:07:15.334 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
He's not.

00:07:15.334 --> 00:07:18.070 align:start size:94% position:6%
The overwhelming majority
of our supporters

00:07:18.070 --> 00:07:21.941
