because they understand

00:07:21.941 --> 00:07:27.146
that we cannot have four
more years of Donald Trump

00:07:27.146 --> 00:07:28.548 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That's clear.

00:07:28.548 --> 00:07:30.383 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I think what he also
understands --

00:07:30.383 --> 00:07:32.852 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know, when he goes to thes
rallies is that,

00:07:32.852 --> 00:07:34.887 align:start size:94% position:6%
our campaign,
