really strong support.

00:07:45.665 --> 00:07:47.700 align:start size:94% position:6%
People feel deeply
about the issues

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:50.636 align:start size:94% position:6%
that I and other progressive
have raised.

00:07:50.636 --> 00:07:52.872 line:92%
And Trump is conscious of that

00:07:52.872 --> 00:07:57.109
He understands that we hav
supporters who desperately

00:07:57.109 --> 00:08:01.581 align:start size:94% position:6%
desperately are demanding
that we pass a Medicare-for-al

00:08:01.581 --> 00:08:02.515 size:78% position:39% line:92%
single-payer program,

00:08:02.515 --> 00:08:03.983 align:start size:94% position:6%
that we deal
with climate change,

00:08:03.983 --> 00:08:06.819 align:start size:94% position:6%
that we deal
with the systemic racism

00:08:06.819 --> 00:08:08.087 align:start size:94% position:6%
and a terrible
immigration system,

00:08:08.087 --> 00:08:11.724 align:start size:94% position:6%
that our people feel
passionately about the nee

00:08:11.724 --> 00:08:15.661
to transform America and creat
a government that works for all.

00:08:15.661 --> 00:08:16.562 size:75% position:38% line:92%
He understands that.

00:08:16.562 --> 00:08:19.232 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Last thing I want to ask you,
you know, in the years

00:08:19.232 --> 00:08:22.702
since you've become sort of more
of a national figure

00:08:22.702 --> 00:08:24.370 align:start size:94% position:6%
with your presidential
campaigns,

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:25.338 line:92%
I think one of the things

00:08:25.338 --> 00:08:28.241 align:start size:94% position:6%
that people
maybe would have expected leas

00:08:28.241 --> 00:08:30.576 align:start size:94% position:6%
