Halsey, Cardi B., Killer Mike.

00:08:34.814 --> 00:08:35.681 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Laughs ]

00:08:35.681 --> 00:08:37.783
-We obviously have talked
about your young support.

00:08:37.783 --> 00:08:42.989 align:start size:94% position:6%
Were you familiar with
these artists five years ago

00:08:42.989 --> 00:08:44.156 align:start size:94% position:6%
