-I promise. This is all off air.

00:08:46.359 --> 00:08:48.794
-Just between you and me, right?
-[ Laughs ]

00:08:48.794 --> 00:08:53.099 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, I was not,
but I will tell you this.

00:08:53.099 --> 00:08:57.770 line:92%
You know, just talking to Du

00:08:57.770 --> 00:09:03.109 align:start size:94% position:6%
and to other
of these young singers,

00:09:03.109 --> 00:09:07.647 align:start size:94% position:6%
I find them to
