00:09:07.647 --> 00:09:11.617 size:81% position:41%
and extremely engaged,
and they understand.

00:09:11.617 --> 00:09:16.389 align:start size:94% position:6%
In terms of Dua, I was looking
you know, at Instagram.

00:09:16.389 --> 00:09:22.495 align:start size:94% position:6%
Her songs have like
500 million views.

00:09:22.495 --> 00:09:23.195 size:78% position:39% line:92%
