00:09:23.195 --> 00:09:24.564 align:start size:94% position:6%
500 -- you know,
we got very excited

00:09:24.564 --> 00:09:26.332 align:start size:94% position:6%
if we got 2 million views.
-[ Laughs ] Right.

00:09:26.332 --> 00:09:28.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
-500 million views
all over the world.

00:09:28.868 --> 00:09:35.341 align:start size:94% position:6%
And what she and the others,
Halsey and others,

00:09:35.341 --> 00:09:41.314
understand that
it's important to use their fame

00:09:41.314 --> 00:09:43.082 align:start size:94% position:6%
and the kind of support
they have

00:09:43.082 --> 00:09:45.685 align:start size:94% position:6%
to bring young people
into the political process

00:09:45.685 --> 00:09:48.588 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I think that
that's a beautiful thing.

00:09:48.588 --> 00:09:49.221 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Well, it is --

00:09:49.221 --> 00:09:51.357 align:start size:94% position:6%
